      ////Friday
      "winter_Fri4": "Some merfolk say that the royal family has a higher aptitude for mermaid magic than your average merperson.$8#$b#I think it's nonsense.$u#$b#Even if they did, what does it matter? Mermaid magic isn't useful for combat. It's just a party trick.$a#$b#Don't tell anyone I said that.$u"
